  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "Le module marketing d'eCommerceGo SaaS est conçu pour révolutionner la façon dont vous faites la promotion de votre entreprise. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Voir la démo en direct",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Améliorez la portée de votre entreprise avec le module marketing",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Boostez vos ventes grâce à notre puissant module marketing, conçu pour rationaliser les campagnes, suivre les performances et stimuler la croissance sans effort.",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Créez et modifiez facilement votre profil d'entreprise",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Démarrer une nouvelle entreprise ou gérer plusieurs marques ? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Choisissez parmi une variété de thèmes professionnels",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "Le module Marketing propose également une gamme de thèmes commerciaux personnalisables pour améliorer la présentation de votre marque. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Stimulez la croissance avec des campagnes marketing personnalisables",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Faites passer votre entreprise au niveau supérieur en lançant des campagnes de marketing dynamiques directement depuis la plateforme. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Rationalisez vos efforts de marketing avec des outils tout-en-un",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Avec le module marketing, gérer les efforts marketing de votre entreprise n’a jamais été aussi simple. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Pourquoi choisir des modules dédiés",
  "for your business?": "pour votre entreprise ?",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Avec EcommerceGo, vous pouvez gérer facilement toutes les fonctions de votre entreprise à partir d'un seul emplacement.",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "Donnez du pouvoir à votre main-d'œuvre avec EcommerceGo",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "Accédez aux modules complémentaires Premium pour les demandes de renseignements sur les produits, les évaluations de produits, l'aperçu rapide des produits et bien plus encore, le tout en un seul endroit !",
